# What Prettier has no business reformatting in this tree.
#
# A second copy of the repository-root `.prettierignore` on purpose: Prettier
# reads exactly one ignore file, the one in the directory it is invoked from,
# and this tree is checked from `site/` by its own CI job and its own pinned
# Prettier. Nothing is inherited from the parent directory - without this file
# a check started here would walk `dist/` and `.angular/` (enigma2_player-63s).
# At the cutover this tree becomes the only one, and this file the only copy.

# Build output.
dist/
.angular/
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Generated: written by a script, so formatting it by hand is undone next run.
package-lock.json

# Prose, not code. Line breaks in prose are an editorial decision, so they stay
# with the author - the reasoning is spelled out in the root copy.
*.md
